  "notes": [
   "The 'Major Core Requirements (16-19 units)' heading covers both the three required courses (KINT030, BIOL047, BIOL048 = 13 units) and the Movement Based Courses; the 16-19 stated total is recorded on the core block but includes the movement courses.",
   "Movement Based Courses rule: 'Select a maximum of one (1) course from any three (3) of the following areas for a minimum of three units.' Areas are 1 Aquatics, 2 Combatives, 3 Dance, 4 Fitness, 5 Individual Sports, 6 Team Sports; recorded as a single choose_courses block of 3 with the one-per-area limit described here.",
   "Movement course units were printed in a separate column and matched to codes by position within each area; counts align for every area.",
   "Catalog codes with trailing zeros (KINS6.10, KINS4.20, KINS4.30, KINS4.40, KINS11.10, KINS7.10, KINS7.20, KINS12.20, KINS8.10) were matched to closed-list KINS 6.1, 4.2, 4.3, 4.4, 11.1, 7.1, 7.2, 12.2, 8.1.",
   "KINS7.15, KINS7.16, KINS7.17 (Pickleball) and HSCI008 (Contemporary Health and Society) are not in the closed list.",
   "List A: 'Select two' with 'Only one:' groups (chemistry, statistics, PSYC/SOCI, physics); each group is recorded as one entry with alternatives, so at most one course per group counts.",
